  "description": "Jihoon is confident that he can easily make guys, even straight ones, fall for him. It worked quite well up until he met Gyungwoo. Jihoon works as a nude model and is introduced to Gyungwoo for his personal photograph project. Gyungwoo appears nonchalant to Jihoon's looks, deeply hurting his pride. Now, Jihoon is determined to make Gyungwoo fall for him.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/297008781), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=2267209) [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/48729364), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/comic/dw_0759), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/you_orz), [Bookcube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=200073), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/take_you)\n\n**Official English:**  \n[Lezhin](https://lezhinus.com/en/comic/fallforme), [Manta](https://manta.net/en/series/fall-for-me?seriesId=3198), [Renta](https://www.ebookrenta.com/renta/sc/frm/item/144781)",
